  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>Tokenized stocks distributed value rose 18.6% over 30D:</strong> Tokenized equity distributed value at $3.32B (18.6% higher over 30D) shows the early lane still adding balance sheet on a small set of platforms. Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/10/14/former-ftx-europe-chief-targets-u-s-stock-tokenization-with-new-sec-exemption\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Former FTX Europe chief targets U.S. tokenized stock trading with new SEC exemption</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Tokenized stocks remain an early-stage lane:</strong> liquidity and scale are still concentrated in a small set of platforms/networks. Related: <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxNSW54VnhraGZTRk1UdDQzNEdxbG1iRjZ1T1FvQ3JQY0c1ZmxmSUt3OHZ0amNzSXd5YzJlZmpqd2o5SWlGeHd6bC1ZanhEZ2JVczl4N0NmcWNqWFhIYmUxdzVJRkxBMWJsT1lsdXViNFB0SnU5UWxVeG5UM3RDSFpCVjRSR0RvVFBWZVM0emp3cEVzOEVVZXl5RURiaXh0ZW9MVUQwcGJJX1d3NjhaRW5Wc0xadXFMN0doSExTd2dxSQ?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">FTX-linked fintech Perpetuals (PDC) plans tokenized stock trading under SEC framework</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Regulatory framing still decides product access:</strong> Securities and broker-rule constraints often set the pace more than listing count, so near-term share stays tied to venues that can actually distribute products. Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/policy/2026/10/13/largest-philippines-crypto-exchange-coins-ph-said-to-face-central-bank-regulatory-action\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Largest Philippines crypto exchange, Coins.ph, said to face central bank regulatory action</a> (CoinDesk).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
